{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 5, :comments ["<b>And tents</b> [ואֹהָלִים]: In my opinion it is singular on the pattern of קֹדֶש, and it is what is found, and the plural: \"for in tents\" [בָאֳהָלִים] (Jeremiah 35:7), like \"in the holy things they shall not eat\" [בַקָדָשים לא יאכל] (Leviticus 22:4). And אֹהָלים with a holam between the alef and the vav is singular, like גורל — if it is not found [in that form elsewhere]."], :book :genesis, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 13, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"] ["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:44:27.371607167Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}